-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🎯 Project Objective

The goal of this project is to **analyze Zomato restaurant data** to extract meaningful insights related to:

* Restaurant ratings
* Online delivery & table booking
* Cost distribution
* Popular restaurant types
* City-wise and category-wise trends

This project focuses on **EDA (Exploratory Data Analysis)** using **Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, and Seaborn**.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📊 Dataset Description

The Zomato dataset typically contains information such as:

* Restaurant name
* Location / city
* Online order availability
* Table booking
* Rating
* Votes
* Average cost for two
* Restaurant type
* Cuisines

📌 Dataset Source: Kaggle / public Zomato dataset

