🧹 Step 3: Data Cleaning

Handling Missing Values

* Drop columns with excessive missing values
* Fill missing ratings & costs where required

```python
df.isnull().sum()
```

---

Removing Duplicates

```python
df.duplicated().sum()
df.drop_duplicates(inplace=True)
```

---

Data Type Fixing

* Convert ratings to numerical
* Convert cost columns to integer/float
* Clean text columns (strip spaces)

